## 1. Ship 1 — completion

Leftover: initialize has no completionProvider. No textDocument/completion.
&Fs at a real cursor does not yield &FsCap.

Would still pass if the bug remained:
  grep -q completionProvider cli/*.oo
  (source can hold the catalog while bin/ooda lsp never serves it)

CRIT-S1 — new shell each time, cwd worktree root:

    timeout 30 ./bin/ooda run scripts/lsp_complete_smoke.oo

