    ./bin/ooda bench                      exit 2
      usage: ooda bench <file.oo> [--run]
    neither prints ooda bench: ok

Revert to the stub prints ooda bench: ok and exits 0 on hello and
on a missing file. That fails this CRIT.

Supporting, not sufficient: strings has no `ooda bench: ok`.

